can escape the asteroid field.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to survive the harsh environment of space and escape before your ship is blown to smithereens?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on sentient gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your experience on Rocky Mayhem, you will encounter the 3 Deities of Mayhem. You must take them all on to earn freedom of the asteroid field and the intergalactic police once and for all. Face Volcanic and Frozen in Classic mode, and prepare yourself for the final showdown with the Reality Deity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play various other modes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the main game comes Arcade. A small selection of minigames with different objectives. Fight against  the intergalactic police or take a chill search in a maze of tunnels for a stranded drillship. With constant updates to these minigames, there's nothing that you won't enjoy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current modes include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Wanted</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue Operations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evasion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your ship with unlockable cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and earn in-game money to splash on fancy cosmetics. Rocky Mayhem features a vast, colorful selection of 47 skins and a 'Limited Time Cosmetic' which rotates occasionally, featuring a constant switch up in the ship customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SepSlither"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303350/06598ec